  <running_head>P. VOET</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">præsentiâ cohortis alapa petẽ[?]</l>
    <l n="2">eum, qui injuriam eam passus</l>
    <l n="3">est, infligitur. Et insuper, ar-</l>
    <l n="4">mis spoliatus, è cohorte ejici-</l>
    <l n="5">tur. Quin imo si verbalis sit</l>
    <l n="6">injuria, ea reparabitur aperto</l>
    <l n="7">capite, quandoque armorum</l>
    <l n="8">seu cinguli privatione &amp; exi-</l>
    <l n="9">lio.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Dixi in continenti, injurias</l>
    <l n="11">alicui illatas esse vindicandas.</l>
    <l n="12">id est, ut judicium super</l>
    <l n="13">injuriis, quam celerrime fieri</l>
    <l n="14">potest, terminetur, ne homines</l>
    <l n="15">litibus hujusce modi pernicio-</l>
    <l n="16">sis pendentibus, ad immorta-</l>
    <l n="17">les &amp; capitales inimicitias</l>
    <l n="18">progrediantur, &amp; ita tandem</l>
    <l n="19">desperatione adacti, dum sibi</l>
    <l n="20">jus denegari videant, aut saltem</l>
    <l n="21">restitutionem contumeliæ il-</l>
    <l n="22">latæ protelari, ad injuriarum</l>
    <l n="23">reparationem sibi de mediis</l>
    <l n="24">prospiciant. Hinc etiam in</l>
    <l n="25">exercitu moris est ut, si à mi-</l>
    <l n="26">lite miles sit contumelia affe-</l>
    <l n="27">ctus,</l>
  </main_text>
